id: pm-rust-sldg
title: Match published stale session-lock refusal diagnostics
description: "The real stale-session-lock differential confirms that both implementations refuse unforced expired session locks after durable item/history writes. The native SDK returns LockConflict with a generic locked diagnostic, while the published SDK returns PmCliError exit 4 with a stale-lock explanation. Preserve the no-auto-recovery oracle policy while matching the diagnostic and CLI envelope."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: conformance,ownership
