updated_at: "2026-10-14T10:39:01.428Z"
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rust-u4al
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T10:39:01.427Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 PR 77 probes also cover start_task semantic publication failure: a stale session-state lock preserves the claim but prevents the lifecycle update. Published SDK propagates the claim error with exit_code 4 and empty context; published CLI uses command_failed and supplies no persisted-claim inspection hint. Native preserves raw LockConflict with the existing differing generic diagnostic/CLI exit. Do not add lifecycle partial_failure wrapping while repairing these diagnostics: the oracle wraps only the subsequent update."
